    "plain_text": "Edward Warrington was an American software entrepreneur who founded Warrington Associates, a business serving banks and other financial institutions. He sold his controlling interest to Systems Designers International and retired to Florida. Born in Pasadena, California, he later settled in Sarasota and served as president of the Alabama-based Warrington Development Corporation.",
